<p>Also&#8230; I can't fathom a situation where this wouldn't have killed everyone already unless 1) The Foundation created it, and 2) They immediately knew its properties and had the resources to enact the containment procedures like OMG RIGHT NOW. I upvoted because I do like it but that's a hell of a plot gap.</p>

